                        "username": "SunnySrivastava1984"
                    },
                    "message": "The API is used in case of \"deleteFruVpd\". What happens to that API if the path is returned empty?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/json_utility.hpp",
                    "line": 608,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "RekhaAparna01",
                        "email": "vrekhaaparna@ibm.com",
                        "username": "RekhaAparna01"
                    },
                    "message": "Deletion does not depend on the JSON.\n\nIf the API \"getFruPathFromJson\" returns empty string, isActionRequired for preAction will return false.\n\nSo, It is not required to do an external check to see if it is an empty string."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/json_utility.hpp",
                    "line": 608,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "SunnySrivastava",
                        "email": "sunnsr25@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SunnySrivastava1984"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                }
            ],
